{
  "pros": [
    "Securely generates and stores complex passwords",
    "Seamless autofill and cross-device synchronization",
    "Affordable and good for small team credential sharing"
  ],
  "cons": [
    "Browser extension might require frequent re-login or manual locking for updates",
    "Initial setup can be slightly less intuitive than desired",
    "Organization and sharing features can be less discoverable or integrated"
  ],
  "changed": [
    "Con 3: 'Occasional clunkiness or minor inconsistencies in the app interface' was replaced with 'Organization and sharing features can be less discoverable or integrated' because the notes highlighted specific friction points around setting up organizations and sharing, which is a more specific and impactful long-term concern than general clunkiness for team-oriented users. (Justified by: 'The personal vault Add menu has no Collection option; sharing requires first creating an organization from a 'New organization' link tucked into the vault filter sidebar.' and 'After creating the organization the app jumps from Password Manager into a separate Admin Console with its own sidebar, so my saved CRM and note items were not visible where collections and members are managed.')"
  ]
}
